  "body": "Architecturally designed by acclaimed Shanahan Architects and completed in 2016, this distinctive Milford residence delivers contemporary elegance, privacy and generous family living. Beautifully appointed with sophisticated interiors, the home enjoys a tranquil, elevated setting framed with picturesque views towards the sea and Rangitoto Island.\r\n\r\nRendered brick and cedar construction make an exceptional design combination built to last. \r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, a stunning designer kitchen features expansive stone benchtops, premium Miele appliances, induction cooking and a Vintec wine fridge. A generous scullery provides additional preparation space, gas cooking and a second dishwasher. \r\n\r\nLiving areas flow seamlessly to an expansive sun drenched deck, perfect for alfresco dining and entertaining friends. \r\n\r\nPrivately positioned upstairs, the luxurious master suite features a substantial walk in wardrobe and elegant ensuite with a freestanding bath, double vanity and twin shower heads. \r\n\r\nFour generous bedrooms downstairs include a guest suite with its own ensuite, while a separate living area opens to landscaped gardens and decking, an ideal retreat for teenagers, extended family or guests.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully considered throughout, the home offers five bedrooms, three beautifully finished bathrooms, a guest powder room, separate laundry, double internal access garaging and additional off street parking with a remote secure gate entry.  \r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in one of Milford's most desirable coastal pockets, morning beach walks, village cafés, restaurants and boutique shopping are all moments away. Excellent schooling, including Milford Primary, Takapuna Normal Intermediate and Westlake Boys' and Girls' High Schools, further enhances the appeal.",
